 The best branded apparel company for construction in Las Vegas is one that specializes where general promo shops don't. For Las Vegas construction crews, that's Bighorn Threads. We do FR rated workwear, ANSI 107 compliant hi-vis, and hard hat safe branding, all embroidered or DTF printed and shipped within 10 business days. We serve GCs, MEP subs, and data center contractors across the valley.
 </p>
