 A promo catalog can print your logo on a shirt. It can't keep your safety gear compliant, turn it around in a week, or look you in the eye over the FR fabric. Here's where a real construction apparel vendor pulls ahead.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
